# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-22 03:40:04 UTC

Base revision: `5af0810d`. This entry records the request 3001
`createUser` Broker RPC slice. Pinned Java source is
`efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`.

## Compatibility changes

- Added `UserInfo`, preserving Java's four nullable string properties,
  null-omitting JSON encoding, public accessors/factories, and identity
  equality; added nullable `CreateUserRequestHeader`.
- Added `MQClientApi::create_user` for request 3001 with the Java header/body,
  caller timeout, Broker error mapping, and the supplied address unchanged
  even when VIP channels are enabled.
- Added invoked Java/Rust cases for populated/default/null-field bodies,
  success, Broker rejection, exact body bytes, timeout, and VIP-enabled
  unchanged-address behavior. Added the header to the public inventory and
  Java/Rust typed-frame cross-decode.
- Updated request-code and Phase 6 API/reverse-audit documentation. The
  direct-operation reverse audit now has 7 open rows; wider Phase 18 work
  remains open.

